| Transformation | Effect |
| --- | --- |
| Inverted the four `if/else` pyramids into guard clauses | Max nesting 6 → 2; happy path is the function's last block, unindented |
| Extracted `orderTotal` | `ProcessOrder` now does validate → compute → persist, one job per block |
